 Soviets after a close battle with Sweden."] "\n\n" [:p {} "On the first leg, Norway’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/80563"} "Inger Aufles"] " surprised everybody by leaving her closest rivals Finland, Soviet and Poland around 25 seconds behind, with Sweden in fifth position another 14 seconds behind. Toini Gustafsson skied an excellent second leg for Sweden with the fastest leg-time of the day, but Norway’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/81025"} "Babben Enger-Damon"] ", considered as the weak point on the Norwegian team, fought bravely and sent " [:a {:href "/athletes/81899"} "Berit Mørdre"] " out on the anchor leg with a 15 seconds lead ahead of Sweden, the Soviets in third place another 20 seconds behind. Mørdre skied the fastest anchor leg of the day, and the Norwegians won a surprising gold with a comfortable margin, 21 seconds ahead of Sweden and with Soviet Union another 22 seconds behind in bronze position."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Exchange"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2"] [:td {} "Norway"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"]] [:td {} "57:30.0"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "Lead-Off"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2-1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/80563"} "Inger Aufles"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "19:08.0"] [:td {} "19:08.0 (1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2nd Leg"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2-2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/81025"} "Babben Enger-Damon"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "19:19.5"] [:td {} "38:27.5 (1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "Anchor"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2-3"] [:td {} [:a 